    <item>
      <title>Version 1.0.0</title>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li>Rebranded to FlowIn</li>
          <li>Improved permission prompts for Screen Context</li>
          <li>Fixed reliability issues (secure input, sleep/wake, App Nap)</li>
          <li>Better suggestion display in Outlook and WKWebView apps</li>
          <li>Smart ghost text persistence on space and delete</li>
          <li>Clipboard session management for rapid Tab acceptance</li>
          <li>Redesigned toolbar with collapsible FlowIn widget</li>
          <li>Timed disable options (15m, 60m, indefinitely)</li>
          <li>Auto-update support via Sparkle</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
